# pan-cursor (h7-plane): a press off the handles ((700,300) misses both),
# dragged +50 px and released — the CartesianPlane closed-hand test's
# shape: grab-active while held (in the views.json cursor line), pan after
# release, centre -1.0 in the URL.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query func=x2&a=2&h=1&k=-3
wait 500
move 700 300
wait 200
down
wait 200
move 750 300 over 80
wait 200
up
wait 800
shot pan-cursor
